  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>}</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; ....(1)</p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; ....(2)</p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(3)</p><p>Put the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;from equation (1) in equation (2),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;....(4)</p><p>Put the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;from equation (4) in equation (3),</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>}</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8484;</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>}</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Case I:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Case II:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, two such functions are possible.</p>",
